# @hub-lanes
# SDLC 2 — steer by outcomes. Turns the findings above into ONE mechanical
# decision: a repo whose trailing-14d revert/reopen rate crosses the threshold
# stops auto-merging and parks for a judged merge. DAILY, not weekly, because
# the window slides every day whether or not new findings landed — and 25
# minutes after the Monday miner so a Monday run reads that morning's findings.
# It only ever tightens; nothing in it merges, loosens or widens anything.
45 5 * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/review-tighten.sh >> /root/harness/logs/review-tighten.log 2>&1
